(text "SHVC-SOUND player - ESP32 version (74HCT541N x2 + 74LVC245N + TDA7053A + line out)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bc02e978-7816-422b-80aa-4441978b6c02"))
(text "Data bus: U2(HCT541, write 3.3V->5V) and U4(LVC245 DIR=GND, read 5V->3.3V) are in parallel." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5e2d99ca-2bd2-4409-b386-eaf4e57e845a"))
(text "Firmware must never assert OE_W and OE_R (both active low) at the same time." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "66239b15-aaad-4fd4-866a-05f3d68252f6"))
(text "R7/R8 keep both buffers disabled while the ESP32 boots. R9 keeps /RESET inactive." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 238.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4e3f3b3f-2a93-4fef-a728-3f57c1330391"))
(text "ESP32 DevKit V1 30pin (DOIT type). GPIO16/17 are PSRAM on WROVER boards - use WROOM-32." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "132eade3-e88e-4221-a7eb-f2c053c39d49"))
(text "Amp circuit copied from SHVC-SOUND-KiCad (Arduino version). R5 3.3k -> 5.6k for 3.3V PWM, ferrite bead FB1 -> R10 10 ohm." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "41386ae2-8c4e-484a-b171-8c94aee6d888"))
(text "TDA7053A pin names are inferred from the existing schematic; check the datasheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7ecd75fb-d2a7-48f9-96a0-a38da377e05d"))
(text "MUTE: GPIO15 -> U3 A6/Y6 -> SHVC pin 20. R15 10k pulls it low = muted until firmware drives GPIO15 high." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b063e424-74d0-477c-886a-f5017202d497"))
(text "Line out J5: AUDIO -> 10uF non-polar -> 47k to GND -> 100 ohm -> terminal block (L / GND / R). No amp in path." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "83108387-8afd-401a-bb62-0e07bfb3b999"))
(text "12V (USB-PD) -> U7 M78AR05-0.5 -> D1 1N5819 -> +5V. USB on ESP32 can stay connected (board has VIN diode - check yours)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8ea70e98-1f53-49ff-b75d-e17a0c25df5a"))
(text "Tie all grounds together at one point. Use electrolytics with correct polarity for C1/C2/C4/C5/C11/C12." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4a9674ae-7007-4cd9-abfb-97298580e228"))
